1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,758
Meet Asha. Her team speaks different languages.

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:11,981
नमस्ते। कल की बैठक के लिए शाम चार बजे कमरा तीन में बारह नीली फाइलें लाना।

3
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:17,785
Please bring twelve blue files to room 3 at 4 PM for tomorrow's meeting.

4
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:23,098
Charcha translates your words, using your voice with consent.

5
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:27,251
Then the room changes.

6
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:33,664
Bring twelve blue files to Room Four at 4 PM for tomorrow's meeting, not to Room Three.

7
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:41,947
An earlier confirmation stays with the old message. Alex checks the update, then confirms.

8
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:47,878
Their recap keeps both versions, in both languages, ready to share.

9
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:53,964
See recorded server timings, alongside experimental AI-voice screening.

10
00:00:57,350 --> 00:01:03,573
Room three becomes room four. The original instruction stays in the record.

11
00:01:05,427 --> 00:01:12,165
The update gets a new translation. Earlier acknowledgements stay with the old version.

12
00:01:14,019 --> 00:01:20,550
Each listener can acknowledge the update. The bilingual recap keeps both versions.

13
00:01:21,350 --> 00:01:27,319
Prisma, Evon, and Gnani voices bring interpretation into the meeting.

14
00:01:28,130 --> 00:01:34,406
Listeners sharing a language share translation work. Playback stays ordered.

15
00:01:35,217 --> 00:01:42,550
Hosts admit guests. Voices need consent. Compute starts with meetings.

16
00:01:43,350 --> 00:01:49,358
Recorded timings show translation and speech generation, stage by stage.

17
00:01:52,402 --> 00:01:56,854
Saved performance reports support review after the meeting.

18
00:01:59,898 --> 00:02:06,550
Backend, frontend, and runtime checks support a measurable engineering workflow.

19
00:02:07,350 --> 00:02:11,701
VoiceShield adds audio-based screening and visible status.

20
00:02:12,900 --> 00:02:17,492
Digital-arrest scams make independent caller checks essential.

21
00:02:18,692 --> 00:02:26,550
Ten language options. Teams, workshops, and communities can meet in one place.

22
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:28,390
Charcha.
